  "sections": {
    "pf-4e86d1ca": {
      "type": "pf-4e86d1ca",
      "settings": {
        "pf_be675c4c_value": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni X to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <a href=\"https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/4/en/topic/overview\" target=\"_blank\">User Guide</a> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X. We also offer live customer support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com",
        "pf_6241a4c6_value": "The best part about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that you only need one of them for all your devices! ThePhotoStick Omni X works on:<br><br><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">✓</span></span></strong> Windows computers<br><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">✓</span></span></strong> Mac (Apple) computers<br><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">✓</span></span></strong> Smartphones (iPhones, Android, iOS, etc.)<br><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">✓</span></span></strong> Tablets (Galaxy, iPad, etc.)",
        "pf_905d0eb5_value": "Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>32GB - 12,800 photos<br>64GB - 25,600 photos<br>128GB - 51,200 photos<br>256GB - 102,400 photos<br>512GB - 204,800 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni, check out our <a href=\"https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/4/en/topic/overview\" target=\"_blank\">Official User Guide</a>.</em> ",
        "pf_a18364d6_value": "We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, our team is here to assist you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please get in touch with us&nbsp;at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-return-and-refund-process\" target=\"_blank\">Returns and Refunds</a> page.   ",
        "pf_f2b8dac5_value": "ThePhotoStick Omni X works with all modern computers, smartphones, and tablets right out of the box.<br><br>It's compatible with the following Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and Later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br>- Android: 8.0 and Later<br><br>For more up-to-date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-system-requirements\" target=\"_blank\">System Requirements</a> page. ",
        "pf_fc1e8ee7_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(226, 49, 143);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 117, 197);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 71, 112);\"></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">Give More Than a Gift.</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 49, 143);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 117, 197);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 71, 112);\"></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 49, 143);\"></span> Give Peace of Mind",
        "pf_93dbd2cf_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 117, 197);\"></span>Over 1.5 Million People Trust<br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 139, 216);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 27, 37);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 49, 143);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 117, 197);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 71, 112);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">ThePhotoStick® Omni&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>",
        "pf_0a2ca4a7_value": "Back Up Your Memories in <br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 139, 216);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 27, 37);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 49, 143);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 117, 197);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 71, 112);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">3 Simple Steps</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>",
        "pf_72e137fa_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(237, 214, 9);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(223, 201, 7);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 221, 11);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 207, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 209, 87);\">★★★★★</span></span></span></span></span></span> Rated 5 Stars by 6,000+ Customers",
        "pf_ab54ceb3_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(237, 214, 9);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(223, 201, 7);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 221, 11);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 207, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 209, 87);\">★★★★★</span></span></span></span></span></span> Rated 5 Stars by 6,000+ Customers",
        "pf_c111b754_value": "Frequently<br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 139, 216);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 27, 37);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 49, 143);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 117, 197);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 71, 112);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">Asked Questions</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>",
        "pf_2e8d0274_value": "Protect Your <span style=\"color: rgb(238, 27, 37);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 49, 143);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 117, 197);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 71, 112);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 55, 55);\">Precious Memories</span></span></span></span></span></span> With ThePhotoStick® Omni",
        "pf_3894c5f4_value": "As someone who is awful with tech, I was worried this would be complicated, but it’s actually really simple. The app walks you through everything step-by-step. I love the new photo scanning feature because I was able to digitize old printed photos from my parents. That alone made it worth it.",
        "pf_04d71e4d_value": "Cherish and protect a lifetime of memorable moments with ThePhotoStick® Omni. <br><br>With our #1 photo backup device, you can effortlessly safeguard your precious photos and videos and ensure your memories last forever. No monthly fees, no stress, just priceless moments preserved.",
        "pf_d4e2e972_value": "This is one of those devices that you never knew you needed until you got one. My phone is loaded with thousands of photos, so when I want to find one, it takes a long time. With this nifty little gadget, I can now offload all of those photos that I can't bring myself to delete.",
        "pf_c3df2450_value": "Absolutely love the fact that the instructions were easy to follow &amp; I was backing up my phone files in no time at all. It works so fast too &amp; is such a convenient, time saving device. Fantastic service &amp; prompt delivery. Many thanks!&nbsp; —Helen P.",
        "pf_e881d08f_value": "Create special memories together and easily keep each photo and video safe with ThePhotoStick® Omni.<br><br>With our #1 photo backup device, you can effortlessly safeguard a lifetime of memorable moments. <b>Get yours today and save BIG!</b><br>",
        "pf_eb983378_value": "It was so easy to connect and download photos and files from my cell phone. You can bring it anywhere. It's lightweight and fits easily in your pocket or your purse. Easy to put on and take off. Very simple. Did exactly what I expected it to do.",
        "pf_32632be5_value": "<strong></strong>Of course! Visit our website, thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST ",
        "pf_4bb9b792_value": "We are so confident you will love ThePhotoStick® Omni&nbsp;that we offer a no-risk 30-Day Money Back Guarantee!&nbsp;If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase, our team is happy to help you with an easy, hassle-free return.<br>",
        "pf_1a7a003a_value": "This stick holds thousands of pictures and videos. Then you can plug it into your TV or laptop and look through the pictures or watch the videos. No more buying storage or being afraid of losing your memories if you phone breaks.",
        "pf_0f7ee70e_value": "ThePhotoStick Omni X will actually find and back up MORE than just photos and videos. <br><br>It also does documents, voice memos, and music files - over 100 different file types - and automatically organizes them for you.",
        "pf_fe23656d_value": "Absolutely love the fact that the instructions were easy to follow &amp; I was backing up my phone files in no time at all. It works so fast too &amp; is such a convenient, time saving device.&nbsp; —Helen P.",
        "pf_750158a8_value": "<strong></strong>Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people us&nbsp;the ThePhotoStick Omni X for&nbsp;weekly backups&nbsp;to make sure they are continually protecting their memories. ",
        "pf_8694b725_value": "Keep your summer memories safe! ThePhotoStick&nbsp;Omni makes it effortless to protect those once-in-a-lifetime moments without the stress of&nbsp;losing them. ",
        "pf_8ee770ee_value": "From family adventures&nbsp;to fun-filled&nbsp;weekends... while you’re making new memories, ThePhotoStick Omni makes sure you never lose the old ones.",
        "pf_fb3729c2_value": "Organize and protect over 100,000&nbsp;photos and videos without hidden fees or&nbsp;costly&nbsp;subscriptions.",
        "pf_50b3d431_value": "We understand&nbsp;once you've purchased, you want it ASAP. That's why we promise speedy shipping to your door.",
        "pf_1181f338_value": "We provide a seamless SSL encrypted checkout to ensure your shopping experience is smooth and worry-free.",
        "pf_3dfccff5_value": "Select 'BACKUP FILES NOW' and that's it! ThePhotoStick® Omni will do the hard work for you.&nbsp;",
        "pf_a4a775a7_value": "No technical knowledge needed. If you can plug in a USB stick, you can use ThePhotoStick® Omni!",
        "pf_7588e9ce_value": "Effortlessly back up files from phones, tablets, and computers, all in one secure place.",
        "pf_0a8cde05_value": "Just download the FREE mobile app, plug in ThePhotoStick Omni, and let it get to work!",
        "pf_76ffbc2d_value": "Pamela R.&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(247, 209, 87);\">★★★★★</span>",
        "pf_f4bedd09_value": "Sherry H.&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(247, 209, 87);\">★★★★★</span>",
